    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Gharston Roland left home at 15, made his way to Los Angeles, and drifted into hired killing before being murdered in a back-alley deal gone bad. His sire Keller, a Lost Angel, Embraced him to help him escape a vengeful anarch gang; Keller was destroyed but Gharston escaped using his newly discovered powers. Archbishop Valez allowed him to join the pack and undergo the Creation Rites despite Tobias Smith's objection that he was not properly Embraced by an active member. Gharston is now the Lost Angels' faithful enforcer, endlessly wandering Montreal listening for trouble.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Not a typical enforcer &mdash; quiet and almost scholarly, turning to violence only as a last resort. The @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} gave you the life you always wanted, and you would gladly meet Final Death to repay it.</p><h2>Secrets</h2><p>Gharston suspects there is more to Pierre Bellemare than meets the eye.</p>",
    "notes": "Embraced 1983. Apparent age: early 20s. Carries two 9mm pistols loaded with silver bullets; tattoo of a spiral dragon on left cheek. @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.MkHKLOcOCLQ5pWCj]{Path of Honorable Accord} 6. Disciplines (as printed): Animalism 3, Celerity 2, Chimerstry 5, Fortitude 2, Obfuscate 1, Potence 3.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
