      "name": "Chimerstry — 3 Advanced — Horrid Reality",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Your illusions can affect a person's mind directly: illusory shackles restrain, illusory wounds are believed real, and you may craft arrows that never miss or Rötschreck-inducing flames that cannot be doused. Works on only one victim at a time. Expend a Willpower Trait and win a Social Challenge; wounds remain until the victim is convinced they were illusory or heals himself psychologically. Vampires 'killed' enter torpor; mortals fall into a coma.</p>",
        "source": "Faith and Fire, Disciplines",
        "discipline": "Chimerstry",
